FFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-on[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-on/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Threshold config and TaskTriage suppression[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]triage[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]triage: add the grouped `bead.task_triage` config block with its three [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fields, schema entries, and fail-open accessors, add the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]staleness/suppression predicates, and teach the bead_task_triage chop to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]withhold a TaskTriage gate from a sub-threshold ready task bead and to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancel the ones it already raised.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]BeadStaleCleanup gate contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate: build the trusted BeadStaleCleanup gate kind — constants, payload,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-bead select/unselect inputs, spec builder, payload-pure preview, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]command wrapper, response translation, adapter registration, and kind [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validation.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]BeadStaleCleanup host effects[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]actions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]actions: close the beads a reviewer selected, grouped per project [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the locked bead-store mutation and commit path, and route the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]answered gate to that effect from the adapter.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bead_stale_cleanup chop[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chop[dim] · [dim][/dim]after triage, actions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop: extract the shared enabled-project inventory, add the hourly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead_stale_cleanup chop with its own lane state and reconciliation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register it in the housekeeping lumberjack and the console-script table,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drop the epic symbol whitelist entries the earlier phases needed.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation sweep and full verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chop[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: reconcile the axe, notifications, beads, and configuration [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guides against the landed behavior, state the post-land rollout step [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that dismisses the reviewer's existing sub-threshold notifications, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]land a green check-full.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-on","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-on.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-b53d69491078a79e59260a401c2e650b","started_at":"2026-08-17T15:48:59.559805+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"74e41ca7830e4e921d1779f68754307b9f04bbf125d20cc33494a0624ae74d9c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.5--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":2798},"commits":{"digest":"06ac035bb107e996565bf88bb4ccc80f9971904722f3eb630f539f2c882ceccc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-on.5--mon/co